NAME
    vedit - full-screen text editor

SYNOPSIS
    vedit

DESCRIPTION
    A text editor in the style of MS-DOS EDIT, text-mode only.
    22x78 editing buffer; the buffer starts as a single blank
    line and is not loaded from disk at startup.

KEYS
    Arrows / Home / End / Del / Backspace / Enter  edit text
    Esc    enter the command line at the bottom

    In command mode:
      s [file]  save to a file
      o [file]  load a file
      q         quit (asks if modified; q! forces)
      h         help
      Enter / Esc  return to editing
